    "intended_rule": "Lowest median measured p95 across three matched repetitions with zero HTTP/check failures and zero dropped arrivals; default SLO p95 <300 ms and p99 <1000 ms.",
    "outcome": "No repeated reliable fastest or capacity ranking was established on this busy host. The platform variant had the only completely passing Java25 run; failed runs are excluded from capacity claims.",
    "provisional_rationale": "At the supported Java 25 baseline and 10 offered RPS, platform dispatch passed the complete mixed warmup and measurement with zero errors/drops, p95 61.27 ms and p99 232.12 ms. Virtual dispatch had zero measured errors/drops but p95 373.91 ms and 17.85% warmup errors, so did not qualify. Platform dispatch is retained as the provisional choice. The earlier overloaded 300 RPS pair favored virtual dispatch, but both runs failed and are not a capacity basis.",
    "next_validation": "Run the shared benchmark runner on an idle Linux host using the Java 27 baseline and three or more repetitions before treating this choice as a capacity result. The recorded source hashes and measurements predate the Java 27 build target."
  },
